{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Cookie is a ",["l","烹饪","cooked dish"],". It is prepared using either the kitchen inside an upgraded ",["l","农舍","farmhouse"]," or a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],"."]],["p",["The Cookie recipe is normally obtained during ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],"'s 4-heart event. If, however, players experience a bug in which they view Evelyn's event but don't receive the recipe, it will be sold at ",["l","星之果实酒吧","The Stardrop Saloon"]," for 300g."]],["p",["Cookies can be received as a gift from ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"]," at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],", and are rarely found in the ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," outside ",["l","河间大道1号","George and Evelyn's home"]," or outside the saloon. Evelyn sells five Cookies in her ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," ",["l","沙漠节","shop"]," for 20 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s each. Cookies may randomly appear in ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],"' shop on ",["l","周循环","Saturdays"]," or in ",["l","星之果实酒吧","the Stardrop Saloon"],"'s rotating stock. One Cookie may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],". If the player's character is male, after he earns 5,000g he will receive a ",["l","妈妈和爸爸","letter from mom"]," with cookies enclosed."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Cookie is an option in the Childrens Bundle."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Cookie is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create a ",["l","裁缝","Shirt"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as an orange dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["One Cookie may be requested by ",["l","水滴鱼","Blobfish"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 5 to 7."]]]],["Notes",2,[["p",[["l","巧克力蛋糕","Chocolate Cake"]," uses the same ingredients as Cookies, but sells for more and is loved by ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", and ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", and liked by ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", whereas Cookies are disliked by Leah and only liked by Abigail, Evelyn, and Jodi."]]]],["Secret",2,[["d","Details",[["p",["A Cookie placed on a ",["l","家具","table"]," or ",["l","家具","long table"]," will be exchanged for a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"]," during the night of ",["l","冬季","Winter"]," 24th, the eve of the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],". If there are multiple tables with Cookies, only one will turn into a Mystery Box."]]]]]]]}